{"repository":{"pullRequest":{"createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:49:04Z","author":{"__typename":"User","login":"babakks","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36728931?v=4","name":"Babak K. Shandiz"},"timelineItems":{"pageInfo":{"hasNextPage":false,"endCursor":"Y3Vyc29yOnYyOpPPAAABoV5bY5ABqzMzODQyNzA3NDI5"},"nodes":[{"__typename":"ReviewRequestedEvent","id":"RRE_lADODKw3uc8AAAABYTlQ2s8AAAAH1ghnfQ","createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:49:05Z","actor":{"__typename":"User","login":"babakks","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36728931?v=4"},"requestedReviewer":{"__typename":"Bot","login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4"}},{"__typename":"ReviewRequestedEvent","id":"RRE_lADODKw3uc8AAAABYTlQ2s8AAAAH1ghpCg","createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:49:05Z","actor":{"__typename":"User","login":"babakks","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36728931?v=4"},"requestedReviewer":null},{"__typename":"ReviewRequestedEvent","id":"RRE_lADODKw3uc8AAAABYTlQ2s8AAAAH1ghsKw","createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:49:06Z","actor":{"__typename":"User","login":"babakks","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36728931?v=4"},"requestedReviewer":{"__typename":"User","login":"sergiou87","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1083228?u=fe3443fc9bbd4e615a34041cb4c26ac45c44e7c8&v=4"}},{"__typename":"PullRequestReview","id":"PRR_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABTDO4aA","state":"COMMENTED","body":"<!-- ccr-overview-v2 -->\n\n### \ud83d\udfe1 Changes recommended\n\nDebug-only behavior needs HTTP-client logging regression tests and a tagged CI test invocation.\n\n<details open>\n<summary><strong>2 open issues</strong></summary>\n\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Run ghdebug override tests in CI](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#discussion_r4315292740) \u00b7 New\n- <picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.svg\"><img src=\"https://github.githubassets.com/static/images/icons/copilot-code-review/medium-v2-light.png\" alt=\"Medium severity\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" align=\"texttop\"></picture> [Add HTTP client tests for verbose refresh override](https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#discussion_r4315292868) \u00b7 New\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>What changed in this PR</strong></summary>\n\nMoves refreshable-token testing overrides behind the `ghdebug` build tag, keeping them unavailable in regular builds.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Adds optional debug configuration and a `make debug` target.\n- Marks debug binaries in version output.\n- Updates guided scripts and expands refresh assertions.\n\n| File | Description |\r\n| ---- | ----------- |\r\n| script/\u200brefreshable-token-gitcredential-e2e.sh | Requires debug builds and renames overrides. |\r\n| script/\u200brefreshable-token-e2e.sh | Updates overrides and adds warning/refresh checks. |\r\n| pkg/\u200bcmd/\u200bversion/\u200bversion.go | Marks debug builds. |\r\n| pkg/\u200bcmd/\u200bversion/\u200bversion_test.go | Tests both version formats. |\r\n| pkg/\u200bcmd/\u200bfactory/\u200bdefault.go | Uses build-gated refresh logging configuration. |\r\n| Makefile | Adds debug build target. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig.go | Defines optional overrides. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig_enabled.go | Parses debug-only environment settings. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig_enabled_test.go | Tests parsing and invalid values. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig_disabled.go | Disables overrides in regular builds. |\r\n| internal/\u200bdebug/\u200bconfig_disabled_test.go | Tests environment isolation. |\r\n| internal/\u200bconfig/\u200brefreshable.go | Applies build-gated expiry overrides. |\n</details>\n\n<sub>Review effort: Balanced</sub>","url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#pullrequestreview-5573425256","submittedAt":"2026-10-19T14:53:27Z","createdAt":"2026-10-19T14:53:26Z","author":{"__typename":"Bot","login":"copilot-pull-request-reviewer","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/946600?v=4"}},{"__typename":"ReviewRequestedEvent","id":"RRE_lADODKw3uc8AAAABYTlQ2s8AAAAH1hh1JQ","createdAt":"2026-10-19T15:00:30Z","actor":{"__typename":"User","login":"babakks","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36728931?v=4"},"requestedReviewer":{"__typename":"User","login":"williammartin","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1611510?u=1208184deacce6d59b31fb28f8464688c577ffdf&v=4"}},{"__typename":"PullRequestReview","id":"PRR_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABTDW24g","state":"COMMENTED","body":"Hey @babakks,\n\nSorry, I have to leave as my day is over. This is a slightly sloppy review starting point \ud83d\ude05\n\nI feel 3/10 strongly about the testing comments. However, I feel strongly about the rebuild decision because plain `make` should reliably produce a regular build.\n\nThe PR description is very helpful, especially the walkthrough and reviewer notes.\n","url":"https://github.com/cli/cli/pull/14752#pullrequestreview-5573555938","submittedAt":"2026-10-19T15:03:07Z","createdAt":"2026-10-19T15:03:07Z","author":{"__typename":"User","login":"williammartin","avatarUrl":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1611510?u=1208184deacce6d59b31fb28f8464688c577ffdf&v=4"}},{"__typename":"PullRequestReview","id":"PRR_kwDODKw3uc8AAAABT